hifiberry-eeprom (1.3.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed compatibility with libgpiod 2.x (gpiod >= 2.0)
  * Added automatic version detection for libgpiod API compatibility
  * Support for both old gpiod 1.x and new gpiod 2.x APIs
  * Improved GPIO chip path handling (/dev/gpiochip0 vs gpiochip0)
  * Enhanced error handling for GPIO initialization failures

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Tue, 15 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000

